# A repeat's row is replaced by no entry: the hourly cleanup, which takes only rows a newer entry replaced, leaves
# every repeat's row in the table, however old, with the alarm's last one.
database real
retention 50
rules tests/corpus/notify/repeat.conf
chart loop.n loop.n_name loop.notify disks things 1
var loop.n v 70
clock 0
pass 0
clock 2
pass 2
clock 4
pass 4
var loop.n v 10
clock 6
pass 6
clock 200
cleanup
clock 201
alarm-log 0
